{"id":"empresa","lemma":"empresa","pos":"noun","rank":944,"glosses":["company","enterprise, undertaking","task"],"ipa":"/emˈpɾesa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"empresas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-empresa.wav","formAudio":{"empresas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-empresas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo trabajo en esta empresa.","en":"I work at this company.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458574","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"this","l":"este"},null]},{"text":"Mi empresa tiene éxito.","en":"My company is successful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599077","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"success"}]},{"text":"Ésta no es la empresa que solía ser.","en":"This isn't the company it used to be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354285","words":[{"g":"this one","l":"éste"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be accustomed to…","l":"soler"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Él es el dueño legal de la empresa.","en":"He is the lawful owner of the company.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/688876","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"owner"},{"g":"legal"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Las pequeñas empresas a menudo son absorbidas por una compañía mayor.","en":"Small businesses are often absorbed by a major company.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788448","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"small","l":"pequeño"},null,null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"company"},{"g":"of age"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"often, oftentimes"]]}]}